                "retweet_count": 28,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Happy to be at the White House today where President Trump announced a new \u2018Making Health Technology Great Again\u2019 initiative! @POTUS @SecKennedy and @DrOzCMS are utilizing AI technology to improve access to patients' electronic medical records. The information used in these records will make it easier for patients to be diagnosed using AI. This will save lives and improve the quality of life for those who voluntarily participate. A great step forward.",
