                "text": "This ceremony marks a major milestone for Bennett County Hospital and the South Dakotans it serves. We officially broke ground on a much-needed expansion that will enhance access to healthcare in one of the most rural regions of our state. Rural hospitals are a lifeline for the communities they support, and this project represents a crucial investment in their future. Congratulations to the community leaders who made this expansion possible.",
